// D&D's real rider ("moving doesn't provoke opportunity attacks") has no engine
// equivalent -- this engine has no attacks-of-opportunity system at all
// (checked common/src/combat.rs and common/src/states/ for any such mechanic).
// Modeled as a straightforward Hastened mobility buff instead ("your stride
// flows as freely as a gust"); the AoO-immunity rider is dropped. The sheet's
// damage_type: Force is flavor metadata only -- SelfBuff has no damage_kind
// field to place it in (its core effect is utility/mobility per the sheet's
// own notes).
SelfBuff(
    buildup_duration: 0.3,
    cast_duration: 0.1,
    recover_duration: 0.2,
    buffs: [
        BuffDesc(kind: Hastened, data: BuffData(strength: 0.1, duration: Some(60.0))),
    ],
    energy_cost: 35,
    meta: (school: Some(Transmutation), source: Some(Primordial)),
)
